      data:
        initialized: 1
        wait: 1
        lines:
        - Ah, the dungeon! Our hero has to get out of this maze, alive, and fast.
        - But the door at the far end is locked, and the key is somewhere in here.
        - 'To the key: straight, then right, then left, then right, then right, then left, then left, then right,'
        - Then left, then left, then left, then right, then right, then left, then right, then left,
        - Then left, then right, then left, then left, then right, then right, then left, and there it is!
        - Then the door. Mind the spikes, and forget the barrels!
        - '{Action!}'
        translate: 1
        maxWaitForDirector: 3
